            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elund ekok i itha ku dwande ma tek, m’ewacu kumae, Wuketh ju m’ugwoko adhura gicor ceng’ni, ku ba dhanu ku ba dhanu ng’atuman ku jambali pare mi nyoth i cinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man nen, dhanu abusiel ubino m’uai yo dhugang’ ma yo malu, m’ulokre yor ariwa ma malu, ku ba dhanu ku ba dhanu ng’atuman jambali pare mi nek ni i cinge; man ng’atu acel m’i kindgi bedo aronya ku bongu ma nwang’, ku tung mi vino pa jagor i ng’ete. E gimondo, man gicungo ng’et pemblam mi mola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
